{"summary":"马绊绳是拴马的绳索，烧灰或煎水外用，可治疗小儿癫痫、鼻中疮等病症。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）","translation":"出自《本草纲目》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"煎水，洗小儿痫（苏恭）。烧灰，掺鼻中疮（时珍）。","translation":"煎水，用来洗浴小儿癫痫（苏恭）。烧成灰，敷撒在鼻中疮上（李时珍）。"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8%E9%83%A8#馬絆繩","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:40.129Z"}